<h3>Why Modularity Matters</h3>
<p>Each agent is designed to work with your existing tools: webhooks, REST APIs, and configurable knowledge bases. That means no rip-and-replace—you keep your CRM, your calendar, and your support queue, and the AI sits in the middle. Escalation paths are explicit (e.g. low confidence, sensitive topic, or user request), so human agents get full context when they take over. This approach has been used in healthcare triage, real estate inquiries, eCommerce support, and outbound sales; the same patterns apply wherever you have high-volume, repetitive communication that still needs a human safety net.</p>

